@startuml
participant 前端 as Frontend
participant JwtAuthenticationFilter as Filter
participant JwtUtil as JWT
participant CustomUserDetailsService as UserDetailsSvc
participant SecurityContext as Context
participant Controller as Controller

Frontend -> Filter: 请求(携带Token)
Filter -> Filter: getJwtFromRequest() 提取Token

alt Token存在且有效
    Filter -> JWT: validateToken()
    JWT --> Filter: 验证通过
    Filter -> JWT: getUsernameFromToken()
    JWT --> Filter: username
    Filter -> UserDetailsSvc: loadUserByUsername()
    UserDetailsSvc --> Filter: UserDetails
    Filter -> Context: setAuthentication()
    Filter -> Controller: filterChain.doFilter() 放行请求
    Controller --> Frontend: 业务响应
else Token无效或不存在
    Filter -> Controller: filterChain.doFilter() 放行(公开接口或401)
    Controller --> Frontend: 业务响应或401
end
@enduml